132	 * focus trap, initial focus, focus restore, body-scroll lock, and Escape/overlay-click-to-close
133	 * all still come from Chakra exactly as before; only the slide transition itself is now ours.
134	 *
135	 * Renders the inline header row (title left — empty when there's no `title` text — close button
136	 * right) when either `title` or `boxedHeader` is passed, or a floating close button only when
137	 * neither is — see ZimmDrawer's own docblock for when each is used.
